        }
      },
      "title": "Keys are made in the browser",
      "description": "### Keys are made in the browser\n\n**DSA topic:** 2. Digital signatures (Ed25519)\n\nThe company's **Ed25519 key pair** is created on its own computer. The private key is encrypted with the passphrase *before* it is sent, so the server never sees it."
    },
    {
      "file": "shared/keystore.ts",
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 26,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 33,
          "character": 2
        }
      },
      "title": "Encrypting the private key with the passphrase",
      "description": "### Encrypting the private key with the passphrase\n\n**DSA topic:** 1. SHA-256 hashing\n\nThe passphrase is stretched with **PBKDF2 (SHA-256, 200,000 rounds)** into an AES key. This makes guessing passphrases slow."
    },
    {
      "file": "server/app.ts",
      "selection": {
