        "end": {
          "line": 83,
          "character": 4
        }
      },
      "title": "The server stores the new company as 'pending'",
      "description": "### The server stores the new company as 'pending'\n\n**DSA topic:** 3. Hash map / hash set\n\nThe account starts as **pending**: it cannot sign batches, dispatch or receive until approved.\nThe company is also added to the `ix.parties` **hash map**, so its key can be found in O(1) later."
    },
    {
