        }
      },
      "title": "Checking the GSTIN check digit",
      "description": "### Checking the GSTIN check digit\n\nThe last character of a GSTIN is a **check digit** computed from the first 14 (a mod-36 weighted sum). A typo or a made-up GSTIN almost always fails this."
    },
    {
      "file": "server/app.ts",
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 186,
          "character": 1
