        }
      },
      "title": "Automatic checks shown to the regulator",
      "description": "### Automatic checks shown to the regulator\n\nFor each pending company the server runs: the GSTIN check digit, whether another company already uses this licence number, whether another uses this GSTIN, and whether a document is attached."
    },
    {
      "file": "server/app.ts",
