        }
      },
      "title": "Approving = signing the company's key",
      "description": "### Approving = signing the company's key\n\n**DSA topic:** 2. Digital signatures (Ed25519), 3. Hash map / hash set\n\nThe regulator **signs** the new company's id, role and public key (`UG/endorse`). Anyone can check later who vouched for this company.\nThe status changes to approved in the database and in the **hash map**."
    }
